# Data Directory

This directory will contain JSON configuration files for game content:

- `world/` - World generation parameters
- `biomes/` - Biome definitions
- `items/` - Item definitions
- `weapons/` - Weapon configurations
- `enemies/` - Enemy data
- `races/` - Player race definitions
- `classes/` - Character class definitions
- `quests/` - Quest configurations

Currently empty - will be populated in Phase 5 (Data-Driven Content).